License for the converted MULE weights (model.safetensors)
==========================================================

The pretrained weights distributed with / produced by this project are a
direct numerical derivative of the original MULE model weights released by
Pandora Media, LLC. / SiriusXM in:

    https://github.com/PandoraMedia/music-audio-representations

